@CRM_ComputerRepair.api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7042

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### MASTER DB
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 1. Get companies
GET {{CRM_ComputerRepair.api_HostAddress}}/companies
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get company databases
GET {{CRM_ComputerRepair.api_HostAddress}}/company-databases
Accept: application/json

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### COMPANY 1 (TenantA) — existing data
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 3. Test tenant 1 connection
GET {{CRM_ComputerRepair.api_HostAddress}}/test-tenant/1
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get customers for Company 1 (should show Juan Dela Cruz)
GET {{CRM_ComputerRepair.api_HostAddress}}/tenant/1/customers
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get suppliers for Company 1 (should show Davao Tech Supply)
GET {{CRM_ComputerRepair.api_HostAddress}}/tenant/1/suppliers
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get parts for Company 1
GET {{CRM_ComputerRepair.api_HostAddress}}/tenant/1/parts
Accept: application/json

### 7. Get repair requests for Company 1
GET {{CRM_ComputerRepair.api_HostAddress}}/tenant/1/repair-requests
Accept: application/json

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### COMPANY 3 (TenantB) — new tenant
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 8. Test tenant 3 connection
GET {{CRM_ComputerRepair.api_HostAddress}}/test-tenant/3
Accept: application/json

### 9. Create Customer for Company 3
POST {{CRM_ComputerRepair.api_HostAddress}}/tenant/3/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Maria",
  "lastName": "Santos",
  "email": "maria@example.com",
  "phone": "09181234567",
  "address": "Cebu City",
  "isActive": true,
  "createdAt": "2026-09-13T12:00:00"
}

### 10. Get customers for Company 3 (should ONLY show Maria Santos)
GET {{CRM_ComputerRepair.api_HostAddress}}/tenant/3/customers
Accept: application/json

### 11. Create Supplier for Company 3
POST {{CRM_ComputerRepair.api_HostAddress}}/tenant/3/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierCode": "SUP001",
  "supplierName": "Cebu Office Supply",
  "contactPerson": "Ana Lim",
  "contactNumber": "09186667777",
  "emailAddress": "sales@cebuofficesupply.com",
  "address": "Cebu City",
  "notes": "COD",
  "isActive": true,
  "createdAt": "2026-09-13T12:05:00"
}

### 12. Get suppliers for Company 3 (should ONLY show Cebu Office Supply)
GET {{CRM_ComputerRepair.api_HostAddress}}/tenant/3/suppliers
Accept: application/json

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### ISOLATION TEST — Compare Company 1 vs Company 3
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 13. Company 1 customers (should NOT include Maria Santos)
GET {{CRM_ComputerRepair.api_HostAddress}}/tenant/1/customers
Accept: application/json

### 14. Company 3 customers (should ONLY include Maria Santos)
GET {{CRM_ComputerRepair.api_HostAddress}}/tenant/3/customers
Accept: application/json

### 15. Company 1 suppliers (should show only Davao Tech Supply)
GET {{CRM_ComputerRepair.api_HostAddress}}/tenant/1/suppliers
Accept: application/json

### 16. Company 3 suppliers (should show only Cebu Office Supply)
GET {{CRM_ComputerRepair.api_HostAddress}}/tenant/3/suppliers
Accept: application/json